slug: change-order-decks
title: Change order template for deck builders (free PDF) | Jobchit
description: A free, printable change-order form for deck builders. Size, decking and framing, footings, railings and stairs, permit changes, the new total and both signatures. No account needed.
heading: Change order for decks
sub: For when the customer wants a bigger deck or different decking. Fill it in and get both signatures before you cut anything.
tips:
  - Write the new size in feet and the square footage, so the price change is easy to follow.
  - If the change touches footings, framing or height, check whether the permit or plans need a revision, and write down who handles it.
  - Note any inspection that has to happen before you build over the new work.
  - Both sides sign and date it before the extra work starts. Give the customer a copy.
  - Some states have their own rules for change orders. Check with your state licensing board.
---
